{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2023-01-11 06:28:00', 'title': 'SYNDIO PARTNERS WITH BROADRIDGE FOR PAY EQUITY AS FINANCIAL SERVICES SECTOR LOOKS TO DELIVER ON THE "S" IN ESG', 'text': "GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER WILL EMPLOY SYNDIO'S ANALYTICS PLATFORM TO BETTER MEASURE, ACHIEVE AND PROVE MEANINGFUL AND LASTING EQUITY IN THE WORKPLACE SEATTLE , JAN. 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNDIO, THE WORLD'S LEADING WORKPLACE EQUITY ANALYTICS PLATFORM, ANNOUNCED A NEW PARTNERSHIP TODAY WITH GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS (NYSE: BR). THE COMPANY IS EMPLOYING SYNDIO'S TECHNOLOGY TO BETTER ENABLE THE CRITICAL STEPS OF MEASURING AND DEEPENING THEIR COMMITMENT TO PAY EQUITY."}